WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:19.980
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:19.980 --> 00:23.620
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:30.990 --> 00:34.530
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru
kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:38.200
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.200 --> 00:42.160
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi
no koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.750 --> 01:00.060
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

01:00.060 --> 01:03.690
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.690 --> 01:07.300
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.210 --> 01:24.950
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:24.950 --> 01:28.710
<b>Let it go, Shinjiyou</b>

01:35.460 --> 01:36.960
<b>Merciful Goddess...</b>

01:36.960 --> 01:39.560
<b>What? No taking back moves now.</b>

01:39.560 --> 01:41.550
<b>No, it's about Sanzo's party.</b>

01:42.400 --> 01:44.130
<b>It's rather late for
me to be saying this,</b>

01:44.130 --> 01:47.230
<b>but I'm finally beginning to see
why you chose those four.</b>

01:48.540 --> 01:52.710
<b>Certainly, they're like
walking, talking heresies,</b>

01:52.710 --> 01:54.540
<b>but at times the way
they live their lives</b>

01:54.540 --> 01:57.840
<b>seems more eloquent
than any holy lecture.</b>

01:58.610 --> 02:00.740
<b>I can't help but feel that way.</b>

02:01.780 --> 02:05.480
<b>It's nothing cool like
that. They're just...</b>

02:07.160 --> 02:09.520
<b>...living in the here and now.</b>

02:22.900 --> 02:24.740
<b>It's hot!</b>

02:24.740 --> 02:29.510
<b>It's already damn hot, so why do
we have to dress like this too?!</b>

02:29.510 --> 02:32.710
<b>If you wanna get covered in
sand, just take it off, Monkey!</b>

02:32.710 --> 02:35.950
<b>Don't make me talk. I'm
getting sand in my mouth.</b>

02:35.950 --> 02:39.650
<b>YOU stay away from me!
It's hot, damn it!</b>

02:39.650 --> 02:43.060
<b>Shut up, it's crowded in
here, you roast monkey!</b>

02:43.060 --> 02:46.090
<b>Who're you calling a roast monkey,
you shriveled-up water sprite?!</b>

02:46.090 --> 02:47.580
<b>Wanna fight, you bastard?!</b>

02:48.400 --> 02:51.130
<b>You want to be iced that badly?</b>

02:51.130 --> 02:53.000
<b>No, thank you.</b>

02:53.000 --> 02:57.670
<b>Now, don't do it, Sanzo. They'll
rot before they get cold.</b>

02:57.670 --> 03:00.800
<b>But still, it's a sea of sand
as far as the eye can see.</b>

03:01.680 --> 03:05.180
<b>Shall we tell some scary stories
so we can all get some chills?</b>

03:05.180 --> 03:07.150
<b>I actually know quite a few.</b>

03:07.150 --> 03:11.410
<b>No, I think the last person I want
to hear horror stories from is you.</b>

03:13.620 --> 03:15.680
<b>Hey, isn't that a person?</b>

03:16.660 --> 03:18.130
<b>Hey!</b>

03:18.860 --> 03:21.950
<b>How much longer do we have to
go to get out of this desert?</b>

03:22.600 --> 03:24.730
<b>Are you travelers?</b>

03:24.730 --> 03:28.100
<b>It'll take almost a whole night
to get out of this desert.</b>

03:28.100 --> 03:30.140
<b>For real?</b>

03:30.140 --> 03:32.440
<b>That's a problem.</b>

03:33.170 --> 03:37.410
<b>My village is nearby. If you want,
we can put you up for the night.</b>

03:37.410 --> 03:38.880
<b>All right!</b>

03:39.610 --> 03:42.150
<b>Well, you're a lifesaver.</b>

03:42.150 --> 03:46.450
<b>Yeah, travelers get lost
a lot in this desert.</b>

03:46.450 --> 03:49.590
<b>You guys were lucky he found you.</b>

03:49.590 --> 03:53.530
<b>Pardon me, but why's there a
village in a place like this?</b>

03:53.530 --> 03:58.770
<b>Well, just a while back,
this was a respectable town.</b>

03:58.770 --> 04:01.740
<b>But a year ago, the
desert suddenly expanded,</b>

04:01.740 --> 04:03.800
<b>and now, you can see for
yourselves what happened.</b>

04:04.610 --> 04:06.070
<b>I see.</b>

04:06.740 --> 04:08.980
<b>In other words, the
abnormalities in Shangri-la</b>

04:08.980 --> 04:11.380
<b>are manifesting in
ways like this too.</b>

04:14.580 --> 04:16.120
<b>Hey, those clothes...</b>

04:16.120 --> 04:19.350
<b>You're not... You're not a
Sanzo Priest, are you?!</b>

04:22.860 --> 04:25.030
<b>Sorry, but I can't
let you stay here!</b>

04:25.030 --> 04:26.630
<b>Go find someplace else!</b>

04:26.630 --> 04:29.000
<b>Hey, you take them somewhere!</b>

04:29.000 --> 04:30.460
<b>Hey, wait...</b>

04:33.270 --> 04:36.340
<b>You seem to know the reason for this.</b>

04:36.340 --> 04:38.670
<b>If you don't mind,
won't you tell us why?</b>

04:41.110 --> 04:45.310
<b>About a year ago, when this area
was still part of the town,</b>

04:45.310 --> 04:46.910
<b>a Sanzo Priest came.</b>

04:48.450 --> 04:53.050
<b>They were just stopping by
while on a journey like you.</b>

04:53.860 --> 04:58.690
<b>The entire town welcomed them
because he was a great monk,</b>

04:58.690 --> 05:01.330
<b>but a demon living in
the desert heard about it</b>

05:01.330 --> 05:03.160
<b>and came to eat Master Sanzo.</b>

05:04.570 --> 05:08.000
<b>Why did the demon come
just to eat a Sanzo?</b>

05:08.000 --> 05:10.070
<b>Are Sanzos tasty?</b>

05:10.070 --> 05:13.200
<b>Hey, that's not funny,
coming from you.</b>

05:14.440 --> 05:17.210
<b>The spider woman was
talking about it before too.</b>

05:17.210 --> 05:21.350
<b>If you eat a highly virtuous
monk, you get to live longer.</b>

05:21.350 --> 05:24.580
<b>That's the legend among demons.</b>

05:25.520 --> 05:28.120
<b>In other words, the highest-ranking
monks, Sanzo Priests,</b>

05:28.120 --> 05:31.830
<b>are like the greatest herbal
medicine there is for demons.</b>

05:31.830 --> 05:34.400
<b>Is that story for real?</b>

05:34.400 --> 05:38.990
<b>Who knows? Too bad I've never
been eaten, so I wouldn't know.</b>

05:39.530 --> 05:41.900
<b>So, what about that Sanzo?</b>

05:41.900 --> 05:43.640
<b>He got taken away, just like that.</b>

05:43.640 --> 05:46.310
<b>Just like that? But
he was a Sanzo, right?</b>

05:46.310 --> 05:51.050
<b>Being a Sanzo doesn't make
you demonically strong.</b>

05:51.050 --> 05:56.650
<b>He was probably a proper,
serious, ORDINARY Sanzo.</b>

05:56.650 --> 05:58.950
<b>Oh, I see!</b>

05:58.950 --> 06:00.420
<b>What're you trying to say?</b>

06:01.160 --> 06:03.560
<b>So basically, if we stay here,</b>

06:03.560 --> 06:07.360
<b>you never know when the demon
might attack again.</b>

06:08.230 --> 06:09.400
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

06:09.400 --> 06:11.720
<b>It's not your fault.
Don't let it bother you.</b>

06:12.430 --> 06:14.470
<b>Then it seems it'd be best for us</b>

06:14.470 --> 06:16.630
<b>to get out of here as
quickly as possible.</b>

06:17.670 --> 06:20.510
<b>Is something wrong, Sanzo?</b>

06:20.510 --> 06:22.040
<b>Oh, just...</b>

06:22.040 --> 06:23.780
<b>Hey, kid.</b>

06:23.780 --> 06:27.680
<b>Do you know where
this desert demon is?</b>

06:27.680 --> 06:30.920
<b>Well, I know the general area.</b>

06:30.920 --> 06:32.650
<b>All right, tell us where.</b>

06:33.420 --> 06:37.530
<b>Hey, wait a minute, are you planning
on going to exterminate the demon?</b>

06:37.530 --> 06:39.590
<b>We're not champions of justice.</b>

06:39.590 --> 06:42.730
<b>There's no reason for us to
go looking for the demon.</b>

06:42.730 --> 06:44.930
<b>That's right! It's dangerous!</b>

06:45.900 --> 06:48.930
<b>You have something in mind, Sanzo?</b>

06:50.210 --> 06:51.670
<b>Sort of.</b>

06:57.680 --> 07:00.080
<b>Going out, Your Highness?</b>

07:03.590 --> 07:05.850
<b>It just had to be him.</b>

07:05.850 --> 07:07.520
<b>Ni Jenyi!</b>

07:07.520 --> 07:09.360
<b>Hello!</b>

07:09.360 --> 07:12.530
<b>I've got no time for
your practical jokes.</b>

07:12.530 --> 07:14.330
<b>Excuse us.</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:18.560
<b>Going to kill the Sanzo
Party again, is it?</b>

07:20.270 --> 07:22.040
<b>We got information that</b>

07:22.040 --> 07:25.540
<b>one of the Founding Scriptures of
Heaven and Earth is in the East.</b>

07:25.540 --> 07:28.840
<b>What's most important is
Gyumaoh's resurrection.</b>

07:28.840 --> 07:33.010
<b>And to do that, we must
gather the five scriptures.</b>

07:33.010 --> 07:36.380
<b>That's a higher priority than
killing the Sanzo Party.</b>

07:36.380 --> 07:40.360
<b>All for the sake of your
mother. How touching.</b>

07:40.360 --> 07:42.020
<b>Sob, sob, sob, sob.</b>

07:43.260 --> 07:44.590
<b>Come on, let's go, Kou!</b>

07:44.590 --> 07:46.230
<b>What's precious to you...</b>

07:47.030 --> 07:50.770
<b>You should never let go
of what's precious to you,</b>

07:50.770 --> 07:52.330
<b>Your Highness.</b>

07:52.330 --> 07:53.870
<b>What're you trying to get at?</b>

07:53.870 --> 07:56.000
<b>Just some advice.</b>

07:56.000 --> 07:57.670
<b>Or maybe it's a warning.</b>

07:58.470 --> 07:59.940
<b>See you later.</b>

08:04.050 --> 08:05.510
<b>Brother!</b>

08:06.980 --> 08:09.750
<b>You were gonna leave me behind and
go somewhere again, weren't you?!</b>

08:09.750 --> 08:11.450
<b>Yaone told me!</b>

08:11.450 --> 08:14.320
<b>Please forgive me, Lord
Kougaiji, it just slipped out.</b>

08:15.320 --> 08:19.490
<b>I have orders from Gyokumen Koushu
not to let you out of the castle.</b>

08:19.490 --> 08:20.960
<b>Be good and wait here.</b>

08:22.400 --> 08:25.260
<b>I'll get you something
tasty for a souvenir, okay?</b>

08:28.000 --> 08:31.230
<b>You should never let go
of what's precious to you.</b>

08:32.810 --> 08:34.370
<b>I don't need to be told that.</b>

08:35.480 --> 08:38.600
<b>That's what I live for.</b>

08:40.320 --> 08:42.950
<b>Take care of Lirin, Yaone.</b>

08:42.950 --> 08:45.280
<b>Yes, Lord Kougaiji.</b>

08:47.090 --> 08:49.090
<b>Hey, is this really the place?</b>

08:49.090 --> 08:52.830
<b>That boy said five kilometers
to the north-northeast,</b>

08:52.830 --> 08:54.530
<b>so it should be around here.</b>

08:54.530 --> 08:56.200
<b>The demon who ate the serious Sanzo</b>

08:56.200 --> 08:59.630
<b>is supposed to have
a castle in the sand.</b>

08:59.630 --> 09:02.640
<b>What?! Then how're we
supposed to get inside?</b>

09:02.640 --> 09:07.080
<b>Hey, Sanzo, why did we come all
this way to meet this demon?</b>

09:07.080 --> 09:11.150
<b>If that Sanzo Priest
was really killed,</b>

09:11.150 --> 09:15.480
<b>then one of the Founding
Scriptures of Heaven and Earth</b>

09:15.480 --> 09:18.210
<b>that a Sanzo Priest is supposed
to guard may still be here.</b>

09:19.050 --> 09:23.360
<b>After all, it seems the Gyumaoh
team's collecting these scriptures.</b>

09:23.360 --> 09:25.880
<b>We have to find it before
it falls into their hands.</b>

09:27.300 --> 09:28.760
<b>What's wrong, Goku?</b>

09:30.670 --> 09:32.130
<b>What the hell is this?!</b>

09:32.900 --> 09:34.370
<b>What're you doing?!</b>

09:35.440 --> 09:36.940
<b>You're kidding me, right?!</b>

09:36.940 --> 09:38.010
<b>Goku! Gojyo!</b>

09:38.010 --> 09:38.440
<b>Sanzo, what the hell is this?!
Goku! Gojyo!</b>

09:38.440 --> 09:39.740
<b>Sanzo, what the hell is this?!</b>

09:39.740 --> 09:41.140
<b>A trap?!</b>

09:41.140 --> 09:41.240
<b>It seems that way.
A trap?!</b>

09:41.240 --> 09:42.610
<b>It seems that way.</b>

09:45.580 --> 09:47.580
<b>Goku! Gojyo!</b>

09:47.580 --> 09:49.050
<b>Sanzo!</b>

09:52.220 --> 09:54.780
<b>No! You'll get dragged in too!</b>

10:14.210 --> 10:16.870
<b>Lady Lirin, so this is where you were.</b>

10:17.480 --> 10:19.380
<b>Lady Gyokumen Koushu
is calling for you.</b>

10:21.180 --> 10:22.950
<b>Say, Yaone?</b>

10:22.950 --> 10:23.850
<b>Yes?</b>

10:23.850 --> 10:26.610
<b>Was Kougaiji's mother a nice person?</b>

10:27.720 --> 10:31.560
<b>Brother loves her, so she
must be nice, right?</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:35.750
<b>My mother seems to hate me, but...</b>

10:36.560 --> 10:40.330
<b>Do you think Kougaiji's
mother would like me?</b>

10:41.300 --> 10:42.770
<b>Lady Lirin...</b>

10:46.810 --> 10:52.580
<b>Of course, and the fact that Lord
Kougaiji and I love you proves it.</b>

10:54.120 --> 10:57.570
<b>Yeah! I love you and brother too!</b>

11:09.930 --> 11:11.400
<b>I can't possibly, Master.</b>

11:12.600 --> 11:14.740
<b>I'm grateful you'd think so,</b>

11:14.740 --> 11:17.470
<b>but I'm not a person worthy
of being a Sanzo Priest.</b>

11:18.510 --> 11:23.070
<b>Kouryuu, there's no standard by
which a Sanzo Priest is chosen.</b>

11:25.110 --> 11:26.810
<b>I've ascertained in
these thirteen years,</b>

11:26.810 --> 11:30.950
<b>that what a Sanzo Priest needs</b>

11:30.950 --> 11:35.050
<b>is your strong body and
even stronger heart.</b>

11:39.030 --> 11:42.390
<b>Be strong, Priest Genjo Sanzo.</b>

11:43.460 --> 11:45.590
<b>That was his final smile.</b>

11:46.570 --> 11:49.370
<b>Those were his final words.</b>

11:49.370 --> 11:51.240
<b>And his final wish.</b>

11:53.070 --> 11:57.410
<b>Koumyou Sanzo, my
master, my father...</b>

11:58.350 --> 12:01.940
<b>The only Sanzo Priest
I ever acknowledged.</b>

12:03.020 --> 12:07.620
<b>Sanzo... Being called by
the same name as he was</b>

12:07.620 --> 12:10.180
<b>has constantly served to
admonish me for being weak.</b>

12:20.970 --> 12:22.740
<b>Where am I?</b>

12:22.740 --> 12:25.570
<b>Oh, right, we were swallowed
up by the sand</b>

12:25.570 --> 12:27.970
<b>and invited into the
enemy stronghold.</b>

12:28.940 --> 12:33.380
<b>My arm... No, my entire body's
paralyzed, and I can't move.</b>

12:34.750 --> 12:36.240
<b>A black magic binding spell?</b>

12:42.560 --> 12:44.390
<b>My, are we awake now?</b>

12:44.390 --> 12:48.990
<b>You slept so soundly, though I'm
sure you aren't able to get up.</b>

12:50.400 --> 12:53.170
<b>I'm the mistress of this castle, Renli.</b>

12:53.170 --> 12:55.970
<b>How do you do, Priest Sanzo?</b>

12:56.570 --> 12:59.240
<b>Very poorly.</b>

12:59.240 --> 13:01.780
<b>I'm sorry to hear that.</b>

13:01.780 --> 13:03.440
<b>Where are the others?</b>

13:03.440 --> 13:06.750
<b>Being given a warm welcome
in a separate room.</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:09.080
<b>But you ARE a surprise.</b>

13:09.080 --> 13:12.490
<b>You're the second Sanzo to
come wandering in here.</b>

13:12.490 --> 13:14.260
<b>Did you eat the Sanzo?</b>

13:14.260 --> 13:19.030
<b>He was very delicious, even
though he looked horrible.</b>

13:19.030 --> 13:21.660
<b>You're not afraid, are you? Why not?</b>

13:21.660 --> 13:23.160
<b>No reason.</b>

13:23.160 --> 13:27.600
<b>The Sanzo that came before you was
trembling and chanting sutras.</b>

13:27.600 --> 13:31.440
<b>I thought high-ranking monks
were all uptight geezers.</b>

13:31.440 --> 13:34.340
<b>I never knew there were some
young and pretty ones like you.</b>

13:34.340 --> 13:35.910
<b>I like you.</b>

13:35.910 --> 13:38.410
<b>You obtained eternal
youth, didn't you?</b>

13:38.410 --> 13:41.280
<b>What's the point in eating two Sanzos?</b>

13:41.280 --> 13:44.250
<b>A delicious meal just landed in my lap.</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:46.190
<b>It'd be rude not to eat it,
now wouldn't it?</b>

13:46.190 --> 13:48.720
<b>Fine, then why do you
want eternal youth?</b>

13:48.720 --> 13:52.030
<b>Oh, you don't understand
women, do you?</b>

13:52.030 --> 13:56.590
<b>Women always want to stay
young and beautiful forever.</b>

13:57.600 --> 13:59.730
<b>Don't make me laugh, you old hag.</b>

14:00.300 --> 14:01.970
<b>What did you say?</b>

14:01.970 --> 14:04.940
<b>You think that thick make-up
hides anything?</b>

14:04.940 --> 14:07.370
<b>It's a waste of your efforts.
You make me puke.</b>

14:08.580 --> 14:10.040
<b>Take that back now!</b>

14:10.850 --> 14:14.120
<b>You don't seem to understand
the situation you're in!</b>

14:14.120 --> 14:16.480
<b>I can kill you whenever I like!</b>

14:16.480 --> 14:18.190
<b>Do what you want.</b>

14:18.190 --> 14:19.690
<b>I pity you all the more</b>

14:19.690 --> 14:22.920
<b>that you'll have to live for
eternity with that ugly face.</b>

14:24.430 --> 14:29.060
<b>Hey! Let us out! Come on!</b>

14:29.060 --> 14:30.890
<b>Do you hear me?!</b>

14:32.030 --> 14:35.670
<b>Why don't you give it a rest?
You're just wasting your energy.</b>

14:35.670 --> 14:38.710
<b>They probably won't let us
out even if they hear you.</b>

14:38.710 --> 14:40.580
<b>And unlike that other cell,
this one's real sturdy,</b>

14:40.580 --> 14:44.010
<b>just what you'd expect
of one made for demons.</b>

14:44.010 --> 14:46.780
<b>But Sanzo's not here!</b>

14:46.780 --> 14:49.510
<b>He's the target, right?!
He's in danger!</b>

14:50.280 --> 14:52.850
<b>You think he's the kind of guy
who'll get eaten just like that?</b>

14:52.850 --> 14:56.690
<b>Well, we probably don't need
to worry about getting eaten,</b>

14:56.690 --> 15:00.860
<b>so we must get out of here
before we go to Sanzo's aid.</b>

15:01.560 --> 15:04.400
<b>Man, I'm so hungry.</b>

15:05.030 --> 15:07.570
<b>Before Sanzo gets eaten...</b>

15:07.570 --> 15:09.590
<b>Goku will starve to death, won't he?</b>

15:12.910 --> 15:14.410
<b>What's that sound?</b>

15:14.410 --> 15:16.340
<b>Hey, are you having auditory
hallucinations now?</b>

15:16.340 --> 15:19.940
<b>No! It sounds like paper rutling.</b>

15:25.520 --> 15:27.020
<b>It's a scorpion!</b>

15:27.020 --> 15:31.160
<b>We ARE in the desert. A scorpion
or two wouldn't be surprising.</b>

15:31.160 --> 15:33.560
<b>Well, one or two, I
wouldn't mind, but...</b>

15:37.260 --> 15:39.960
<b>This is obviously not natural, right?</b>

15:46.870 --> 15:49.240
<b>You're way too full of yourself,
you little brat!</b>

15:51.950 --> 15:55.400
<b>Be strong, Priest Genjo Sanzo.</b>

15:55.980 --> 15:59.820
<b>Master, I... I...</b>

16:01.120 --> 16:03.250
<b>I don't like that look in your eyes!</b>

16:03.990 --> 16:05.960
<b>So what if you're a Sanzo?!</b>

16:05.960 --> 16:10.560
<b>In the end, you're just
humans who chant sutras!</b>

16:10.560 --> 16:12.030
<b>Maybe so.</b>

16:14.000 --> 16:15.470
<b>I couldn't protect him.</b>

16:17.040 --> 16:18.700
<b>You're nothing but fodder!</b>

16:22.540 --> 16:24.200
<b>Why can you move?!</b>

16:25.510 --> 16:27.720
<b>Thanks to you hitting
me over and over,</b>

16:27.720 --> 16:29.310
<b>I've awoken from the black magic.</b>

16:31.120 --> 16:33.920
<b>You're right, Sanzos
are nothing but humans.</b>

16:33.920 --> 16:36.050
<b>That's why we're capable
of killing people.</b>

16:37.090 --> 16:39.990
<b>And demons like you are
even easier to kill.</b>

16:41.060 --> 16:45.600
<b>Take that! Take that! Take
that! Take that! Take that!</b>

16:45.600 --> 16:46.530
<b>What're we gonna do?</b>

16:46.530 --> 16:48.470
<b>We have no choice but to
break through the walls!</b>

16:55.380 --> 16:56.840
<b>Good grief.</b>

16:56.840 --> 17:00.720
<b>Hakkai, quit acting calm all by
yourself and do something!</b>

17:00.720 --> 17:06.240
<b>Well, this is the only wall through
which we can escape, but...</b>

17:06.790 --> 17:09.390
<b>Then hurry up and wreck that wall!</b>

17:09.390 --> 17:13.260
<b>But you know, I think it'd
be better if we didn't.</b>

17:13.260 --> 17:15.960
<b>What're you talking about?! You
want to get stung by scorpions?!</b>

17:15.960 --> 17:17.770
<b>Hakkai, hurry!</b>

17:17.770 --> 17:19.230
<b>All right.</b>

17:23.470 --> 17:24.440
<b>Yes!</b>

17:24.440 --> 17:25.900
<b>Okay, let's go!</b>

17:30.010 --> 17:32.110
<b>What're you doing, Hakkai?!</b>

17:32.110 --> 17:33.580
<b>You wanna be left behind?!</b>

17:36.780 --> 17:38.580
<b>You're going to kill me?</b>

17:39.720 --> 17:44.360
<b>Have you forgotten? I ate a
Sanzo, so I'm immortal now.</b>

17:44.360 --> 17:48.260
<b>How ludicrous. You still
believe those stories?</b>

17:48.260 --> 17:49.500
<b>What?!</b>

17:49.500 --> 17:51.030
<b>Do you seriously think</b>

17:51.030 --> 17:53.630
<b>you can become immortal
by just eating a human?</b>

17:54.970 --> 17:58.370
<b>What proof do you have
that you're immortal now?</b>

18:00.010 --> 18:01.880
<b>Shall we test it?</b>

18:01.880 --> 18:03.340
<b>Don't...</b>

18:05.950 --> 18:07.010
<b>Why you...</b>

18:07.010 --> 18:10.650
<b>Well, it looks like you still feel pain,
even when you're immortal.</b>

18:11.490 --> 18:16.080
<b>I bet it'll hurt a lot if I put a bullet
through your head or heart!</b>

18:20.330 --> 18:24.160
<b>This is stupid. This is just stupid!</b>

18:25.300 --> 18:27.060
<b>What're you doing, Sanzo?!</b>

18:27.970 --> 18:31.130
<b>It isn't like you to be so brutal.</b>

18:31.840 --> 18:33.610
<b>Not like me?!</b>

18:33.610 --> 18:35.100
<b>So what IS like me?!</b>

18:35.910 --> 18:37.380
<b>Sanzo...</b>

18:38.950 --> 18:40.410
<b>Goku!</b>

18:43.620 --> 18:46.650
<b>That hurt! What'd you do
that for, you bastard?!</b>

18:46.650 --> 18:49.660
<b>Hit me! Why don't you
call me a stupid monkey</b>

18:49.660 --> 18:51.330
<b>and hit me with your paper fan?</b>

18:51.330 --> 18:53.590
<b>That's the Sanzo I know.</b>

18:57.700 --> 19:01.070
<b>The harsh aura surrounding
Sanzo vanished instantly.</b>

19:02.240 --> 19:04.470
<b>He really is no match for Goku.</b>

19:06.310 --> 19:09.340
<b>Hey, there's one thing I
want to ask you.</b>

19:09.340 --> 19:11.350
<b>The scripture I was wearing</b>

19:11.350 --> 19:15.050
<b>and the scripture the
Sanzo you killed had...</b>

19:15.050 --> 19:16.550
<b>What did you do with them?</b>

19:16.550 --> 19:18.420
<b>Scriptures?</b>

19:18.950 --> 19:21.220
<b>The first Sanzo's scripture</b>

19:21.220 --> 19:24.790
<b>should be lying around
somewhere in the castle.</b>

19:24.790 --> 19:27.160
<b>Yours is on the shelves behind you.</b>

19:27.930 --> 19:29.400
<b>That must be it.</b>

19:31.730 --> 19:33.200
<b>Watch out, Sanzo!</b>

19:38.570 --> 19:40.110
<b>Sanzo!</b>

19:40.110 --> 19:41.810
<b>Sanzo!</b>

19:41.810 --> 19:43.280
<b>Close his wound, Hakkai!</b>

19:44.850 --> 19:46.310
<b>I know that.</b>

19:47.080 --> 19:48.120
<b>This is...</b>

19:48.120 --> 19:51.790
<b>My nails are the poisonous
stingers of scorpions!</b>

19:51.790 --> 19:53.980
<b>And they deliver a lethal
dose of course.</b>

19:57.320 --> 19:58.760
<b>You bitch!</b>

20:00.130 --> 20:01.960
<b>You're not getting away with this!</b>

20:05.300 --> 20:06.960
<b>Man, it's hot!</b>

20:07.640 --> 20:11.970
<b>That's strange.
According to our info,</b>

20:11.970 --> 20:13.670
<b>the castle of the demon with the
scripture should be around here.</b>

20:14.880 --> 20:16.810
<b>What's the matter, Dokugaku?</b>

20:16.810 --> 20:18.940
<b>No, I just saw something
white buried...</b>

20:23.620 --> 20:25.640
<b>Hey, Kou, this is...</b>

20:36.360 --> 20:38.100
<b>Wait...</b>

20:38.100 --> 20:40.120
<b>No taking back moves.</b>

20:43.470 --> 20:49.880
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou
na kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:49.880 --> 20:55.250
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:55.250 --> 21:00.750
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

21:00.750 --> 21:04.160
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

21:04.160 --> 21:09.960
<b>Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:09.960 --> 21:15.370
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:15.370 --> 21:20.710
<b>Kitto dare ni totte
mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:20.710 --> 21:24.640
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:31.650 --> 21:35.290
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:35.290 --> 21:37.260
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:37.260 --> 21:41.400
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:41.400 --> 21:45.500
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:45.500 --> 21:48.200
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:48.200 --> 21:53.240
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa
tonariawase de</b>

21:53.240 --> 21:58.650
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:58.650 --> 22:04.080
<b>Kitto dare ni totte
mo onaji koto darou</b>

22:04.080 --> 22:08.150
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

22:18.100 --> 22:19.530
<b>Next Saiyuki</b>

22:20.800 --> 22:23.900
<b>I wanna save Sanzo no matter what.</b>

22:23.900 --> 22:28.140
<b>But it doesn't look like I can beat
Kougaiji the way I am now.</b>

22:28.140 --> 22:34.110
<b>Hey, Hakkai, Gojyo, will you
somehow stop me afterwards?</b>

22:34.110 --> 22:35.980
<b>I'm counting on you guys!</b>

22:35.980 --> 22:38.750
<b>Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki,
"Berserking Towards Destruction"</b>

22:38.750 --> 22:40.950
<b>Next TimeNBerzerking Towards Destruction
Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki,
"Berserking Towards Destruction"</b>

22:40.950 --> 22:42.190
<b>Next Time
